 - 2026-06-14: PHASE B — GAP-3 Stage-1 model-native ARC energy (CPU; the activation dump ALREADY EXISTS). On results/arc3_gap3_stage1_candidate_table.npz (z_mean (8041,512), votes, q_mean, probe, correct, task_idx): score with (1a) a model-native ORTHOGONAL basis (arXiv:2604.17614) + (1b) the learned OOF probe. Run ALL gates (selection>vote, AUROC>0.70, coverage>=80%, headroom-capture>=30%) + ALL adversarial checks (permutation, strict OOF, oracle-leak, bootstrap CI). Does it reach the proven ~13pp ARC headroom? READ-ONLY w.r.t. TRM training. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: gap3_stage1_model_native_latent_honest_negative_model_native_basis_pca_gold_mahalanobis_delta_0.0000_energy_0.4516_vote_0.4516; results/experiment_4178_gap3_stage1_model_native_arc_energy.json
 - 2026-06-14: PHASE C — ARC-AGI-3 INCREMENTAL +1 (monotonic). Non-spatial first-levels are EXHAUSTED (.386 exp4169 no_unsolved_nonspatial_candidates), so target the NEXT DEEPER LEVEL of an already-solved game (incremental +1 per the ARC discipline) via the PROVEN explore-first method: bounded active-exploration OBSERVES transitions -> induce mechanic + goal predicate -> GAP-4 verifier validates on HELD-OUT transitions -> act only if validated. REAL-ENV-CONFIRM any solve; STOP at the first level that fails. Honest no-solve is COMPLETE. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: incremental_progress_lp85-305b61c3_advanced_to_L2_total14; results/experiment_4179_arc_incremental_progress.json
